  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the Operational Capacity of the Haitian National Police and the Gang Suppression Force through the Refurbishment of Forward Operating Bases and Mobile Control Capabilities in the West Department &amp;#8221;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Enhancing the Operational Capacity of the Haitian National Police and the Gang Suppression Force through the Refurbishment of Forward Operating Bases and Mobile Control Capabilities in the West Department &amp;#8221; - This exceptional assistance measure will contribute to the work of the Multi-National Security Support Mission (MSSM) and Haitian National Police (HNP) in Haiti to improve security and re-establish the rule of law, the respect for human rights and protect civilians, thus paving the way, in the medium-term, for the country&#x252c;&#x2510;s stabilisation and democratic elections.Specific Objectives of the action are: To enable MSSM to provide operational support to the HNP in conducting joint operations, build their capacities and protect critical infrastructures; To enhance the operational capacity of the MSSM and HNP by establishing a network of Forward Operating Bases (FOBs).</narrative>
  </description>
